m your captive held in bonds,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l022","ordinal":301242,"en":"I am a slave within your hands."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l023","ordinal":301243,"en":"I am yours to do with as you will,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l024","ordinal":301244,"en":"I am a man in your own hands."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l025","ordinal":301245,"en":"I am nothing but a captive slave,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l026","ordinal":301246,"en":"Black Khan's dark-eyed son.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l027","ordinal":301247,"en":"When he heard these tidings,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l028","ordinal":301248,"en":"Karagul, chief of the herdsmen—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l029","ordinal":301249,"en":"There stood the sly wretch,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l030","ordinal":301250,"en":"The forceful Karagul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l031","ordinal":301251,"en":"Who from his khan, brave Kyyaz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l032","ordinal":301252,"en":"Had taken his example."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l033","ordinal":301253,"en":"Exceedingly wrathful Karagul"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l034","ordinal":301254,"en":"Grew furious and made ready;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l035","ordinal":301255,"en":"The accursed madman"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l036","ordinal":301256,"en":"Confronted him in a rage:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l037","ordinal":301257,"en":"“Look how this rabid, cunning slave"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l038","ordinal":301258,"en":"Has run mad!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l039","ordinal":301259,"en":"His armor once weighed eighty-four,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b002:l040","ordinal":301260,"en":"Wherever he struck, red fire flared."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l001","ordinal":301261,"en":"While the doomed man still had strength,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l002","ordinal":301262,"en":"He was a mass of glowing embers,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l003","ordinal":301263,"en":"He was a bullet forged of steel."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l004","ordinal":301264,"en":"He was the Kyrgyz people's crimson banner,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l005","ordinal":301265,"en":"And uproar among their enemies."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l006","ordinal":301266,"en":"When he drew breath, he could burst the gall,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l007","ordinal":301267,"en":"A silent, deadly crimson poison."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l008","ordinal":301268,"en":"Now his poison is spent and his strength gone,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l009","ordinal":301269,"en":"His power is exhausted and his blood drained;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l010","ordinal":301270,"en":"All strength has left me, Külchoro."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l011","ordinal":301271,"en":"The armored coat with golden collar and copper sleeves"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l012","ordinal":301272,"en":"Has been stripped from my back."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l013","ordinal":301273,"en":"The host that wrought slaughter at my cry"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l014","ordinal":301274,"en":"Has been taken from Külchoro."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l015","ordinal":301275,"en":"My flesh is but a blue scrap,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l016","ordinal":301276,"en":"My blood no more than a spoonful;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l017","ordinal":301277,"en":"I have no voice with which to shout,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l018","ordinal":301278,"en":"No fistful of hair left to bristle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l019","ordinal":301279,"en":"No tongue with which to speak."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l020","ordinal":301280,"en":"Accursed world, ever stalking me with disaster!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l021","ordinal":301281,"en":"I have no waist on which to bind my belt,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l022","ordinal":301282,"en":"No refuge where I may stand firm,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l023","ordinal":301283,"en":"No dark, rugged mountain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l024","ordinal":301284,"en":"No black cliff to circle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l025","ordinal":301285,"en":"No mountain on which to lean,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l026","ordinal":301286,"en":"No strength with which to strike,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l027","ordinal":301287,"en":"No power left to fight."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l028","ordinal":301288,"en":"Once we brought the whole world to heel"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l029","ordinal":301289,"en":"And dealt doom to all we met—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l030","ordinal":301290,"en":"In former days we were heroes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l031","ordinal":301291,"en":"Now cut off from the living,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l032","ordinal":301292,"en":"Our shoulders gouged on either side,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l033","ordinal":301293,"en":"We gather firewood as slaves,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l034","ordinal":301294,"en":"Unslain, we live as captives,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l035","ordinal":301295,"en":"Poor wretches wandering astray."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l036","ordinal":301296,"en":"Let the lord show mercy—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l037","ordinal":301297,"en":"That is why we beg for a mount."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l038","ordinal":301298,"en":"If your valor is true,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l039","ordinal":301299,"en":"You will heed these words"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0097:b003:l040","ordinal":301300,"en":"And lend me the strength of one horse."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l001","ordinal":301301,"en":"The Argyn Kyrgyz rode forth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l002","ordinal":301302,"en":"Intent on slaughtering heroes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l003","ordinal":301303,"en":"Many a bride and many a maiden"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l004","ordinal":301304,"en":"They kept unmarried for many years;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l005","ordinal":301305,"en":"Those who met them were laid low,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l006","ordinal":301306,"en":"And noble heads were crushed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l007","ordinal":301307,"en":"For mortal folk until doomsday,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l008","ordinal":301308,"en":"It became a deed never to be forgotten."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l009","ordinal":301309,"en":"You ravaged the borders by force;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l010","ordinal":301310,"en":"Though Kyrgyz by birth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l011","ordinal":301311,"en":"You wore the crimson collar."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0098:b002:l012","ordinal":301312,"en":"You did a deed worse than any Chinese warrior."}]
